  "description": "ObjectComparator is a high-performance .NET library crafted meticulously for deep comparisons between objects. Beyond just pointing out the disparities, it delves into the depths of objects, reflecting even the minutest differences. Furthermore, it arms developers with the capability to prescribe custom comparison rules tailored for specific properties or fields.",
